<title>UK: Dec IPE gas oil delivery 87,900 tonnes - IPE.</title>
<headline>Dec IPE gas oil delivery 87,900 tonnes - IPE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical delivery against the expired IPE December gas oil futures contract will be 879 lots, or 87,900 tonnes, an IPE official said on Thursday. </p>
<p>Deliveries against the November contract were a record 865,100 tonnes, while May saw the lowest ever delivery of 12,600 tonnes.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
